@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 15
skinparam LegendFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 28
title Statechart · Job processing status and deletion are separate dimensions\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/models.py#L15
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L60
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L155
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L186
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L412
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/recovery_v1.py#L84
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/recovery.py#L24
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L136
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L184
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 17

left to right direction
state "Job (persisted record; not a Python state-machine class)" as J $PROC {
 state "status" as Life {
  [*] --> queued : submit [new live guard]
  queued --> processing : claim [current queued pair]\n/ lease + task binding + result
  processing --> done : finish [live, valid outputs, error is None]\n/ Attempt=succeeded
  processing --> failed : finish [live, error is not None]\n/ Attempt=failed
  processing --> failed : interrupt [current processing pair;\nexpired OR matched STOPPED]\n/ Attempt=abandoned
  failed --> queued : _retry_locked [new retry identity, not deleted]\n/ NEW Attempt + result/work
  processing --> queued : redirect_to_long_lane [live]\n/ old Attempt=abandoned; NEW Attempt
 }
 --
 state "deletion flag (orthogonal)" as Retention {
  [*] --> visible
  visible --> tombstoned : _cancel_locked\n/ deleted_at; clear outputs; cleanup + result
  tombstoned --> tombstoned : new cancel command\n/ may emit fresh confirmation
 }
}
note bottom of J
All shown status changes require not deleted. Cancel preserves jobs.status, clears outputs and cancels active Attempts.
Snapshot exposes cancelled. Done is terminal for processing; retained Job can still be tombstoned (no final node).
redirect_to_long_lane is called by the NotAdmitted hook; retry/claim cannot resurrect a tombstone.
end note

@enduml
